# Never upload local environment files to Vercel.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* at build time, so a local .env present during a CLI
# deploy poisons the production bundle — it baked http://localhost:8081/api
# into the deployed app. Environment values must come from the Vercel project
# settings, not from this machine.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
dist
.git
